          %p
            By generalizing this definition of binary pushouts from the type of booleans to any arbitrary type, one gets general dependent pushouts of an arbitrary family of functions with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/domain"} domain
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
